@startuml
title 笔记保存时序图 作业3 V0.1
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "阅读者" as Reader
boundary "阅读与笔记界面" as UI
control "笔记控制器" as NoteController
control "版本服务" as Version
control "引用服务" as CitationService
database "笔记仓库" as NoteRepo
control "标签服务" as TagService
control "审计服务" as Audit

Reader -> UI : 选择原文、回答或引用并编辑笔记
UI -> NoteController : saveNote(body, sourceRef, tags)
NoteController -> Version : verifyCurrent(sourceRef.versionId)

alt 来源版本过期、删除或已撤权
  Version --> NoteController : stale(reason)
  NoteController --> UI : 提示重新定位、仅保存为未绑定草稿或取消
  alt 用户选择未绑定草稿
    Reader -> UI : 确认保存草稿
    UI -> NoteController : saveDraft(body, tags)
    NoteController -> NoteRepo : create NoteCard(sourceStatus=unbound)
    NoteRepo --> NoteController : noteId
  end
else 来源有效
  Version --> NoteController : current
  NoteController -> CitationService : snapshotLocator(sourceRef)
  CitationService --> NoteController : version/block/page/section/quote
  NoteController -> NoteRepo : create Annotation或NoteCard
  NoteRepo --> NoteController : noteId
  NoteController -> TagService : attachTags(noteId, tags)
  TagService --> NoteController : normalizedTags
  NoteController -> Audit : record(note_saved, noteId, sourceRef)
  NoteController --> UI : saved(noteId, sourceLocator)
end

UI --> Reader : 显示保存结果和返回原文入口
@enduml

